# Argosbx 官方脚本原生参数示例。编排器只透传下面白名单中的 key，不改写其含义。
# 本文件故意全部注释，不能直接 deploy；复制为 argosbx.env 后，按官方脚本说明取消所需行。
# 至少必须启用一个协议端口。尖括号内容只是占位符，不能作为实例值。
#
# 协议端口白名单（端口必须是 1-65535 的十进制整数）：
# vlpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# vmpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# vwpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# hypt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# tupt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# xhpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# vxpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# anpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# sspt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# arpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# sopt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# nvpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# xupt=<replace-with-instance-port>
# xcpt=<replace-with-instance-port>
#
# 其它官方原生参数白名单；是否需要及取值规则以 yonggekkk/argosbx 当前官方脚本为准：
# uuid=<replace-with-instance-uuid>
# reym=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# cdnym=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# argo=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# agn=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# agk=<replace-with-secret-value>
# ippz=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# warp=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
# name=<replace-with-node-name>
# oap=<replace-with-reviewed-value>
